Use FlexCom20.pkg

Define OLEXTPFrameShadowManagerFlags for Integer
    Define OLExtpFrameShadowsDisabled for 1
    Define OLExtpFrameShadowsInvisible for 2
    Define OLExtpFrameShadowsNotResizeable for 4
    Define OLExtpFrameShadowsDisabledInTSS for 8
    Define OLExtpFrameShadowsInvisibleInTSS for 16

Class cSigCjComIFrameShadow is a Mixin

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Function ComOuterSize Returns Integer
        Integer retVal
        Get ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 1 OLE_VT_I4 to retVal
        Function_Return retVal
    End_Function

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Procedure Set ComOuterSize Integer value
        Set ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 1 OLE_VT_I4 to value
